    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Midpoint is a 2D Metroidvania with RPG elements. Destroy enemies, dodge attacks, and steal spiritual energy from your foes. Be possessed by spirits of light and darkness to gain unique upgrades. Face blessings and curses, and sacrifice certain traits to unlock greater power. Free the world  before being consumed by darkness.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hyperfocus mechanic allows you to absorb energy from the environment and steal energy from your enemies to power your abilities. The closer you are to them, the more effective it becomes at draining their spiritual energy.<br><br>Keep your spiritual energy bar high to deal maximum damage with your basic attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies have passives, such as &quot;Tough Skin,&quot; which blocks damage lower than their shield value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/98f6dd6384961cf2b65d09009b4eef76.poster.avif?t=1739580372\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/98f6dd6384961cf2b65d09009b4eef76.webm?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/98f6dd6384961cf2b65d09009b4eef76.mp4?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>We feature simplified motion inputs: specific combinations of directions and buttons that players must input to execute special moves or advanced attacks. These require precision and practice, making special moves rewarding to master and adding a layer of depth to the gameplay. Like the skill tree ability <i>Reversal</i>: while <i>Air Cut</i> is active, it adds additional hits by alternating \u25c1 \u25b7 repeatedly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/4ac796b1533d51631590159f9cbd82a8.poster.avif?t=1739580372\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/4ac796b1533d51631590159f9cbd82a8.webm?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/4ac796b1533d51631590159f9cbd82a8.mp4?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skill tree, allowing you to enhance each of your main abilities. Choose the path that best suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/5eedd3ef7cd119d6bd01f92ef3096f25.poster.avif?t=1739580372\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/5eedd3ef7cd119d6bd01f92ef3096f25.webm?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/5eedd3ef7cd119d6bd01f92ef3096f25.mp4?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master synergies and strategically combine your abilities to unleash effects far greater than the sum of their parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/b2a6e86c5521258c2a1f9a9a057cf031.poster.avif?t=1739580372\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/b2a6e86c5521258c2a1f9a9a057cf031.webm?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/b2a6e86c5521258c2a1f9a9a057cf031.mp4?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Midpoint is a 2D Metroidvania with RPG elements. Destroy enemies, dodge attacks, and steal spiritual energy from your foes. Be possessed by spirits of light and darkness to gain unique upgrades. Face blessings and curses, and sacrifice certain traits to unlock greater power. Free the world  before being consumed by darkness.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hyperfocus mechanic allows you to absorb energy from the environment and steal energy from your enemies to power your abilities. The closer you are to them, the more effective it becomes at draining their spiritual energy.<br><br>Keep your spiritual energy bar high to deal maximum damage with your basic attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies have passives, such as &quot;Tough Skin,&quot; which blocks damage lower than their shield value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/98f6dd6384961cf2b65d09009b4eef76.poster.avif?t=1739580372\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/98f6dd6384961cf2b65d09009b4eef76.webm?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/98f6dd6384961cf2b65d09009b4eef76.mp4?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>We feature simplified motion inputs: specific combinations of directions and buttons that players must input to execute special moves or advanced attacks. These require precision and practice, making special moves rewarding to master and adding a layer of depth to the gameplay. Like the skill tree ability <i>Reversal</i>: while <i>Air Cut</i> is active, it adds additional hits by alternating \u25c1 \u25b7 repeatedly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/4ac796b1533d51631590159f9cbd82a8.poster.avif?t=1739580372\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/4ac796b1533d51631590159f9cbd82a8.webm?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/4ac796b1533d51631590159f9cbd82a8.mp4?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skill tree, allowing you to enhance each of your main abilities. Choose the path that best suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/5eedd3ef7cd119d6bd01f92ef3096f25.poster.avif?t=1739580372\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/5eedd3ef7cd119d6bd01f92ef3096f25.webm?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/5eedd3ef7cd119d6bd01f92ef3096f25.mp4?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master synergies and strategically combine your abilities to unleash effects far greater than the sum of their parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/b2a6e86c5521258c2a1f9a9a057cf031.poster.avif?t=1739580372\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/b2a6e86c5521258c2a1f9a9a057cf031.webm?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354920/extras/b2a6e86c5521258c2a1f9a9a057cf031.mp4?t=1739580372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
